%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f988bc0d55107749a911c0375bba164, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dial_Professor_DeliveryHandoff
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerNpcId: prof_toby
  playerFacingPolicy: 0
  lines:
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: There it is. Two blacks, still hot, and the beer that kept them honest.
      Give it here.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: prof_toby
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: You did good, pup. Sit a second. The coffee can wait. The chain won't,
      but the coffee can.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: prof_toby
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: I accelerate it. That's the job. I don't steer it. I'm not even sure it
      has a direction.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: prof_toby
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: Bridges, forks, layers, backdoors. This world is bigger than the lab. Bigger
      than both of us.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: prof_toby
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: What I can actually read is the paperwork. Chainling DNA. The metadata
      under the fur.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: prof_toby
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: Catch them, write them down, and bring me the blank pages. Every species
      in Loom.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: prof_toby
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: One of those pages is a trip to the incinerator. Not this one. Leave the
      furnace alone until I say the page is ready.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: prof_toby
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Prof Toby
    text: And thank you for the order.
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: prof_toby
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 2
  allowSkip: 1
  skipToEndOfLine: 1
